  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inebriated and distraught over his fractured operation, FSB officer Eduard Valentinovich stumbles into the communal apartment corridor in search of Marina. Neighbor Klavdiya spitefully informs him that Marina is occupied with Arkady, sparking an emotional outburst.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Мариночка, открой скорее дверь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Она сейчас сидит в туалете.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Она сидит там с Аркашкой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Ой, как это трогательно!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Эдик, ты опять пьяный пришёл?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Иди скорее к себе домой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Я же долго воспитывал тебя!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Я обучал тебя буквально всему.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Перестань кричать на весь коридор.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "А ты оказалась неблагодарной женщиной!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Я больше не буду работать на вас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Ты разбила моё верное сердце!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Хватит шуметь, иди проспись, командир.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Я всё равно не забуду эту обиду.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's explore the pathetic scene as the drunken commander confronts Marina.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Мариночка, открой скорее дверь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Marinochka, open the door quickly!' Eduard calls out affectionately using an intimate diminutive.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Она сейчас сидит в туалете.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is in the bathroom right now.' Klavdiya curtly points out Marina's current location.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Она сидит там с Аркашкой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is sitting there with Arkashka.' Klavdiya adds a malicious detail about Arkady's presence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Ой, как это трогательно!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, how touching that is!' Eduard's sarcastic exclamation barely masks his deep wounded jealousy.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Эдик, ты опять пьяный пришёл?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Edik, did you come drunk again?' Marina reproaches him for arriving in a state of drunkenness.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Иди скорее к себе домой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go to your home right away.' Marina tries to turn him away before a major scene develops.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Я же долго воспитывал тебя!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I raised you for a long time!' Eduard dramatically exaggerates his paternal role in her life.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Я обучал тебя буквально всему.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I taught you literally everything.' The officer claims credit for shaping her personality.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Перестань кричать на весь коридор.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop shouting across the whole hallway.' Marina urges him to lower his voice in the communal house.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "А ты оказалась неблагодарной женщиной!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And you turned out to be an ungrateful woman!' Eduard accuses his former operative of betrayal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "marina",
      "t": "Я больше не буду работать на вас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will not work for you anymore.' Marina firmly severs all remaining ties with the security agency.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Ты разбила моё верное сердце!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You broke my faithful heart!' A melodramatic expression revealing his personal affection.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Хватит шуметь, иди проспись, командир.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Enough making noise, go sleep it off, commander.' Klavdiya bluntly advises him to sober up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eduard",
      "t": "Я всё равно не забуду эту обиду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will not forget this insult anyway.' Eduard vows to hold on to his bitter resentment. Now let's listen to the drunken confrontation in the apartment corridor once more.",
